# The box: Aspect ratio derives the height from the width (or the width from the height).
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: The box · Aspect ratio
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Styles:
		For style: row
			Gap: 20
			Vertical: top
		For style: demo
			Box:
				Background: tint
				Border: 1
				Border color: accent
	Section:
		Text: The box
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Aspect ratio
		Paragraph: `Aspect ratio` is the proportion of width to height, as a fraction or as a number. With one side known, the other follows from it. With `Width` and `Height` at once it would have no effect, and it is an error.
			Style: intro
		Stack:
			Style: row
			Item:
				Block:
					Text: Width: 160, Aspect ratio: 16/9
						Style: label
					Block:
						Style: demo
						Box:
							Width: 160
							Aspect ratio: 16/9
			Item:
				Block:
					Text: Width: 120, Aspect ratio: 1
						Style: label
					Block:
						Style: demo
						Box:
							Width: 120
							Aspect ratio: 1
